# Splunk

Secondary SIEM, installed on the Windows 11 host (not the Ubuntu VM), intended to receive forwarded logs from the homelab as a second point of log analysis alongside Wazuh.

## Status

Installed but not operational — blocked on a license renewal. No log forwarding configured yet.

## Planned next steps

- [ ] Renew license
- [ ] Configure a forwarder on the Ubuntu VM to ship logs to Splunk on the Windows host
- [ ] Decide what's actually worth forwarding (syslog? Docker container logs? both?)